WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
Senior Sister Duanmu said

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,200
Senior Sister Ji needs to take a good rest these two days

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,800
Almost damaged the foundation

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,400
That's a bit pushy

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,800
Junior Brother Chu, I would like to thank you again this time.

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,200
Senior sister, you're welcome

7
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,930
Freshly brewed soup

8
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:14,130
Junior Sister Ji, drink it quickly

9
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:16,330
It will lose its aroma when it cools down

10
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:18,360
Thank you, Sister Duanmu

11
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:25,230
Although the medicine given by senior sister is bitter,

12
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:26,430
But the medicine is very effective

13
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:27,830
Sister Ji, don't be angry

14
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:29,030
Just drink it in one gulp and you'll be fine

15
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:39,050
Did you know earlier that this medicine is bitter?

16
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:40,250
Deliberately seeing me make a fool of myself

17
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:41,650
I really forgot

18
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:44,250
I also drank a lot of bitter medicine prepared by my senior sister before.

19
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:45,450
Is it really bitter?

20
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:48,530
I think it's okay

21
00:00:48,530 --> 00:00:50,930
It’s really hard, sister
